        "raw_start_char": 1044487,
        "raw_end_char": 1048096,
        "primary_text": "Lemma C.1 (Derivative formula for \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} ) . For every f\\in H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) and \\pi_{\\eta}^{Y} -almost every y , \\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]-\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,. (C.8)"
      },
